[0.162, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[4A  This is the core problem with using semantic similarity search for API documentation: \u001b[1mrelevance ≠ \r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m  \u001b[1mrecency\u001b[22m.\u001b[1CThe\u001b[1Cv2\u001b[1Cdocs\u001b[1Cscored\u001b[1Chigher\u001b[1Cbecause\u001b[1Cthe\u001b[1Cquery\u001b[1C\"send\u001b[1Cnotification\"\u001b[1Cis\u001b[1Ca\u001b[1Ccloser\u001b[1Csemantic\r\u001b[1B  match to the v2 vocabulary (\u001b[38;5;105mNotifier.send\u001b[39m) than to the v3 vocabulary                              \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B(\u001b[38;5;105mNotificationClient.dispatch\u001b[39m). The search engine literally pointed\u001b[1Cme\u001b[1Cat\u001b[1Cdocs\u001b[1Cfor\u001b[1Can\u001b[1CAPI\u001b[1Cthat\r\r\n\u001b[2Cdoesn't\u001b[1Cexist\u001b[1Canymore\u001b[1C—\u001b[1Cand\u001b[1Cit\u001b[1Cdid\u001b[1Cso\u001b[1Cwith\u001b[1CHIGHER\u001b[1Cconfidence\u001b[1Cthan\u001b[1Cthe\u001b[1Ccorrect\u001b[1Cdocs.\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;241m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[7m \u001b[27"]
[0.000, "o", "m\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[2C\u001b[38;5;131m⏵⏵\u001b[1Cbypass\u001b[1Cpermissions\u001b[1Con\u001b[38;5;241m (shift+tab\u001b[1Cto\u001b[1Ccycle)\u001b[1C·\u001b[1Cesc\u001b[1Cto\u001b[1Cinterrupt\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[?2026l"]
[0.608, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[4A  The search returned the right topic but the wrong version. And I had no way to know that from the \r\u001b[1B  relevance\u001b[1Cscores\u001b[1Calone.\r\u001b[1B                                                                                                    \r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;174m✻\u001b[1CImagining… \u001b[38;5;241m(1m 1s · ↓\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;241m1.3k tokens)\u001b[39m                              \r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;241m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[7m \u001b[27m\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"]
